  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Metal Face DOOM",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Operation Doomsday",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You were very high",
          "rhyme": "Eg",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "By the way, I re-up on bad dreams, bag up screams in fiftys (Fifty blocks)",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Be up on mad schemes that heat shop like jiffy (Jiffy, pop, pop)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "In an instant, get smoked like Winston cigarettes",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Hoes get ripped off like Nicorette (Patch)",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "In real life, the real trife scene",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Might snatch your life like assault machine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Rifle, dead-up, setup like bull-fight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Be blunted how we like couldn't white or in full flight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "The unemotional, call me anti-social",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "On the run, off the gun death tally commercial",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Death Valley is like rehearsal to the streets",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "To my peeps, GM, MF on the beat",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Rhymes is chosen like the weapons of war",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "So keep from steppin' on my floor or delivery front-door",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I bring it to y'all motherfuckers, master yours",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "My disaster cause Hell in gas drawls",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "The supervillain cooler than a million, I be chillin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Still quick to slice squares like Sicilians",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Don't make me have to hurt them feelings",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I'll ruin you in the dirt that I be doin' in my dealings",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "(While I'm) Sendin' spirits through the ceilin', chrome peelin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Dome blown within the comforts of your own home",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Grown big, wheelin' and high rollin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I hold the lye, it keeps the sty on my eye swollen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "(In the corner) Holdin', foldin' the pal",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Known as massive versatile (I saw you)",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "I'd like to big them up, Monsta Isle (You were very high)",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDEFFGGHHIJKLMNOOMPMQGRS",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCADDDDAADEFBGHAAGIGBDAD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Um",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "In the corner of my eye",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I saw you in Hell with them gas drawls",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You were very high",
          "rhyme": "Eg",
