    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "To my brother Subroc and Black Jewel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I crack brew for two more, three men, two up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I hit the brew up like nobody knows how X the unseen feels",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "When givin' crews a brush with death like between meals",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Two times a day with brothers that's tight like a noose",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "With more rhymes in use than Dr. Seuss",
          "rhyme": "2s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Or motherfuckin' Mother Goose, X the suspicious flirter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Who every hooker heard of, next to malicious murder",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "A track type vicious, fulfillin' the pipe wishes",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "The misses may be legal, minus the baby eagle",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Any given summer's eve, don't breathe",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Sixteen shots, I do believe, and one up the sleeve (In the corner)",
          "rhyme": "iv",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Master of the O who predict your last pause",
          "rhyme": "oz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I told y'all, Hell and gas drawls",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Breakin' glass and plastic jaw like federal drastic law",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Fed up from fightin' secret war with them Fantastic Four",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "(Invisible Bitch) versus DOOM with the metal face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Before I go to state, the ho better settle case",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "The flow is at pedal pace, steady like tricycles",
          "rhyme": "ikl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Beware, all suckers is froze like icicles (In the corner)",
          "rhyme": "ikl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "(Bag 'em up) and baggin' bitches like nickels 'cause I lick 'em where they tickle",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Before I hit the clit though, I'ma spit 'til I pronounce",
          "rhyme": "awns",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "More hits than a ounce, no doubt",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "About to bounce, X the unannounced, I'm out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABACDEFFGHIJKALMNOPPQRST",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABACDEFFGBGCHAHDGGCCGGIG"
    },
